\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Out-of-sample holdout evaluation: GAM vs.\ ARIMA$(1,1,2)$ forecasts against actual cross-city mean CNG price (July 2021--December 2025). Shaded band denotes the GAM 95\,\% confidence interval for the conditional mean, constructed from the asymptotic standard errors of the GLMGam fit; it is not a prediction interval. Note that both models diverge materially from actual prices during major regulatory step-change events, reflecting the absence of upstream/regulatory variables in the current specification.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:forecast}{{1}{4}{Out-of-sample holdout evaluation: GAM vs.\ ARIMA$(1,1,2)$ forecasts against actual cross-city mean CNG price (July 2021--December 2025). Shaded band denotes the GAM 95\,\% confidence interval for the conditional mean, constructed from the asymptotic standard errors of the GLMGam fit; it is not a prediction interval. Note that both models diverge materially from actual prices during major regulatory step-change events, reflecting the absence of upstream/regulatory variables in the current specification}{figure.1}{}}
